      "publicationStatus": "PUBLISHED",
      "required": true,
      "order": 1,
      "body": "# Array Algorithms Introduction\n\nWelcome to Browser Algorithms. This course exercises basic algorithmic patterns and data structures executed entirely in your browser environment.\n\nIn this first module, you will practice:\n1. **Summing positive values**: Filtering and reducing array elements while guarding against boundary cases like empty arrays.\n2. **Sliding windows**: Maintaining state across a fixed-size window over sequential elements to achieve optimal runtime efficiency.\n"
